Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ralphnajm/blurt
Description: Talk anywhere you can type
 Press a shortcut, say it, and Blurt types clean, filler-free text into
 whatever app you are in. Speech is transcribed with OpenAI when you stop
 talking, cleaned of fillers and false starts, and typed into the focused
 window. A settings window keeps the API key in the GNOME keyring and tracks
 spend against a monthly budget, and a top bar menu starts and stops
 dictation.
